                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A game about medieval Europe, caught in the grips of the inquisition. The theme mixes magic and fantasy in with history and does so seamlessly, it feels perfectly places and natural.\n\nYou can create your own Character from scratch choosing your own stats or take a premade one to jump right into the story. \n\nThe game has tons of mechanics from speech checks to lockpicking to 4 kinds of magic to combat. Some are more overpowered than others, of course, but after an overpowered playthrough it is a nice challenge to go for a normal build after as well.\n\nIt still lives up to modern games imho. \n\nYou feel almost like playing a proper pen and paper game with all those random numbers being generated.",
